From 02f83bd6ad20953b98215cbf3473ce6166ffc923 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: t <tristan75015@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 11:11:44 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Test and document the Jacobi preconditioner by nodal blocks

NodalBlockJacobiTest solves a cantilever beam in linear elasticity, with
the unknowns ordered by nodes and by vector dimension, in sequential and
in parallel, on the CPU and on the GPU: same numbers of iterations with
each available backend and with the inverses or the LU factors of the
blocks, blocks of size one equivalent to the Jacobi smoother of MFEM,
fewer iterations with the nodal blocks, convergence of GMRES, inverse of
the block diagonal part of the matrix (one iteration), refusal of invalid
options and of unavailable backends.
